      "description": "In the case of continuation, the first range specifier has an implicit start point and an explicit stop value (Z), e.g., \"npt=-60\", which indicate that it MUST convert the range specifier being played prior to this PLAY request (X to Y) into (X to Z) and continue as if this was the request originally played.",
